ic module,Third parties in scope must demonstrate equivalent compliance. Contractual compliance obligations; right-to-audit clauses; annual third-party assessment,Non-compliance: regulatory action by issuing authority; fines and penalties as specified; operational and reputational consequences,Sector-specific — consult official source,Sector-Specific,,,,,
