CCHI-UBP,Unified Health Benefits Package,First UBP 2018 → expanded 2022 → major expansion 2024-2025,2018 (first): basic coverage package for expat workers. 2022: expanded to include mental health (inpatient + 12 outpatient sessions); physiotherapy. 2024-2025: major expansion — fertility treatment; hearing aids; advanced cancer therapy; telemedicine reimbursement; remote patient monitoring for chronic disease; AI-assisted diagnosis coverage (first-in-region). Unified across all insurers — providers must deliver all UBP services,"First: 2018. Updated: 2022, 2024-2025",Annual update aligned with actuarial review,CURRENT — 2024-2025 expanded version
CMA-CGR,Corporate Governance Regulations,First 2006 → revised 2017 → updated 2023,2006 (first). 2017 (revised): board independence requirements; audit committee mandatory; related party transaction rules. 2023 update: ESG reporting requirements; cybersecurity risk disclosure required in annual report; AI governance disclosure for listed tech companies; health sector: hospital holding companies must disclose cyber incidents material to operations; board-level cybersecurity oversight required,First: 2006. Revised: 2017. Updated: 2023,Review 2025,CURRENT — 2023 version
