CSCC-1:2019,Critical Systems Cybersecurity Controls,CSCC-1:2019 (First issue),"32 main controls / 73 sub-controls extending ECC for critical systems. Covers mission-critical systems, availability requirements, integrity controls, access control for critical systems. Hospital core infrastructure (EMR servers, imaging systems, life support networks) qualifies",Issued: 2019. Mandatory for entities with critical national systems,Review expected 2025,CURRENT — first and only version; update expected
CST-CCR,Cloud Computing Regulatory Framework,First ~2018 → major update 2023 with Cloud Special Economic Zone,"2018 (first): basic cloud computing licensing framework. 2020: security requirements aligned with NCA CCC. 2022: data localisation requirements (government data must remain in KSA). 2023 (major update): Cloud Computing Special Economic Zone established (May 2023 by Economic Cities and Special Zones Authority); cloud provider licensing tiers (Class A, B, C); specific requirements for health cloud providers (Class A = highest security); enhanced sovereignty requirements for sensitive data",First: ~2018. Major update: 2023,Cloud SEZ regulations still evolving; 2025 update expected,CURRENT — 2023 version with SEZ provisions
