CST-TITA,Telecommunications & IT Act,Telecom Law 2001 → renamed CST (from CITC) Dec 2022 → updated 2024,"Original Telecommunications Act 2001. CITC renamed to Communications, Space and Technology Commission (CST) in Dec 2022 gaining space regulatory mandate. 2022-2024 updates: digital content platform regulations; data center licensing; IoT framework expansion; spectrum management for 5G/6G; number portability; consumer protection strengthened; SLA disclosure requirements for cloud providers. Healthcare relevance: telehealth platform licensing under CST",Original: 2001. CST rename: Dec 2022. Updated: 2022-2024,Continuous updates; ICT Strategy 2025+ under development,CURRENT — continuously updated
