DCC-1:2022,Data Cybersecurity Controls,DCC-1:2022 (First issue),"First dedicated data cybersecurity controls from NCA. 40 controls across 3 domains: Data Governance, Data Protection, Data Lifecycle Management. Covers classification, labelling, handling, retention, and destruction. Aligns with NDMO Data Classification Policy and PDPL requirements",Issued: 2022. Mandatory for all ECC-scope entities,Review expected 2025-2026,CURRENT — first and only version
DGA-CFP,Cloud First Policy,Cloud First Policy first 2019 → updated 2021,2019 initial Cloud First Policy from MCIT. 2021 DGA formalised and expanded: all government entities must justify non-cloud deployments; pre-approval process for cloud service adoption; security assessment requirement (NCA CCC compliance verified); Government Cloud (G-Cloud) preferred for classified data; health data must stay within KSA borders unless DGA exemption granted. MOH NABIDH platform on G-Cloud as reference implementation,Initial 2019. Formalised: 2021,Review 2024-2025 aligned with CCC-2 developments,CURRENT — 2021 version
