MHRSD-LL,Labour Law & Implementing Regulations,Royal Decree M/51 2005 → updates 2021 → 2024,2005 (original): basic employment law. 2021 major update: remote work provisions added; flexible work contracts; parental leave expanded. 2024 update: enhanced parental leave (including paternity); anti-harassment provisions; Saudisation penalties strengthened; healthcare sector-specific provisions for 24/7 shift workers; clarified overtime for healthcare workers during emergencies,"Original: 2005 (RD M/51). Updated: 2021, 2024",Biennial review; sector-specific guidance periodic,CURRENT — 2024 version
MHRSD-NITAQAT,Saudisation / Nitaqat System,Launched 2011 → multiple updates; ECC-2 cybersecurity Saudisation 2024,"Nitaqat (Saudisation): quota system by company size and sector. Healthcare sector: tiered quotas for physicians, nurses, pharmacists, admin staff. 2024 critical update — NCA ECC-2 mandates ALL cybersecurity positions in ECC-scope entities (including hospitals) must be filled by Saudi nationals. Colours: Platinum (>>=quota) / Green (meets) / Yellow (below) / Red (significantly below). Non-compliant companies face: work visa bans, government service restrictions",Launched: 2011. Annual sector-specific updates. ECC-2 cyber Saudisation: Oct 2024,Annual quota updates; cybersecurity Saudisation deadline: Oct 2025,CURRENT — 2024 version with cyber Saudisation mandate
