NDMO-DGF,National Data Governance Framework,First approved 2021 by SDAIA Board; updated 2022,"28 governance obligations. Covers data ownership, data stewardship, metadata management, data quality standards, data sharing protocols between government entities. Critical for health data interoperability between MOH, NHIC, CBAHI, CCHI systems. Mandates Data Governance Officer role in government entities",Approved: 2021. Updated: 2022,Biennial review,CURRENT
