NHIC-NABIDH,NABIDH National EHR Platform Standard,NABIDH launched 2018 (pilot) → FHIR R4 API 2022 → mandatory all facilities 2024,2018 (pilot): 10 MOH hospitals. 2019-2021: health cluster rollout. 2022: FHIR R4 API standards published; private hospitals voluntary integration. 2023: API developer portal opened; 40 technical requirements published. 2024: MANDATORY — all healthcare facilities must connect; Private Health Institutions Law updated; penalties for non-connection: facility licensing at risk. NABIDH now the central patient data repository — 45M+ patient records as of 2024,Launched: 2018. FHIR R4 API: 2022. Mandatory: 2024,Continuous platform updates; API versioning quarterly,CURRENT — mandatory as of 2024
