SCFHS-PLF,Professional Licensing Framework,Established 1992 → national revalidation framework launched 2024,1992 (establishment): basic licensing for physicians. Progressive expansion to all health professions. 2015: online licensing portal. 2018: expanded to allied health. 2024: National Healthcare Practitioners Revalidation Framework (regular revalidation every 3-5 years); digital licensing wallet launched; cybersecurity awareness included in CPD requirements; international credential recognition agreements expanded to 45 countries,Established: 1992. Revalidation framework: 2024,Annual updates; revalidation cycle ongoing,CURRENT — 2024 enhanced version
