SFDA-AI-MDS-G010,AI/ML in Medical Devices (MDS-G010),First KSA AI medical device guidance 2024 (no predecessor),"KSA's first AI/ML medical device regulatory guidance. Key provisions: predetermined change control plan for adaptive algorithms; transparency requirements for AI decision-making in diagnosis; risk-based approach (high-risk: AI for cancer screening, sepsis detection, ICU monitoring); post-market performance monitoring for AI models; labelling requirements for AI-enabled devices; clinical validation requirements specific to Saudi patient populations. Aligns with FDA AI/ML Action Plan and EU AI Act healthcare provisions",Issued: 2024,Expected updates 2025-2026 as regulatory science matures,"CURRENT — 2024, first version"
