SFDA-GMP,Good Manufacturing Practice,Based on PIC/S GMP guide; KSA-specific updates 2021; ISO 13485 cross-reference,"Aligned with PIC/S PE 009 Guide to GMP. Major elements: Quality Management System, personnel qualification, premises/equipment, documentation, production, quality control, contract manufacturing, complaints/recall. 2021 KSA update: Arabic GMP inspection forms; Saudi-specific requirements for halal APIs and excipients; enhanced requirements for biologics and ATMPs",Based on PIC/S GMP (continuously updated). KSA update: 2021,Updated with PIC/S revisions; next expected 2024-2025,CURRENT — 2021 KSA version
SFDA-MDR,Medical Device Regulations,Royal Decree M/42 2013 → comprehensive revision 2022,2013: Basic medical device registration system. 2018: Mandatory registration on SFDA e-portal (Estshary). 2020: Class III device pathway accelerated. 2022 comprehensive revision: aligned with IMDRF Global Model; 87 controls covering pre-market/post-market; mandatory UDID (Unique Device Identification) for implantable devices; AI/ML device pathway (leads to MDS-G010 guidance); IVD separate classification. Aligns with EU MDR 2017/745 and FDA 21 CFR Part 820,Issued: 2013. Comprehensive revision: 2022,Next major revision expected 2025-2026 addressing AI medical devices more broadly,CURRENT — 2022 version
