SFDA-PHARMA,Drug & Pharmacy Law,Royal Decree 1978 → major update 2020; accelerated pathways 2023-2025,1978: Basic drug and pharmacy law. Multiple updates to 2020 (comprehensive revision). 2020 update: GMP alignment with PIC/S; pharmacovigilance system (SFDA NPC); smart dispensing pharmacy requirements; electronic prescribing integration. 2023-2025: accelerated approval pathways for oncology and rare disease; conditional approval pathway; real-world evidence acceptance; digital pharmacy licensing,Original: 1978. Major update: 2020. Accelerated pathways: 2023-2025,Annual updates; accelerated pathway regulations ongoing,CURRENT — 2020 base with 2023-2025 pathway additions
SFDA-PMS,Post-Market Surveillance Requirements,First comprehensive PMS regulation 2022,38 control obligations covering: Vigilance reporting timelines (serious incidents: 48 hours; non-serious: 10 days to SFDA); Field Safety Corrective Actions (FSCA) notification; periodic safety update reports; post-market clinical follow-up requirements; trend analysis obligations. IoMT application: connected medical device cyber incidents classified as device safety incidents requiring PMS reporting if patient harm potential exists,Issued: 2022,Review 2025,CURRENT — 2022
