-- ============================================================
-- SECTION 11 — APPLICABILITY ENGINE (DOS Platform/files (9)/)
-- The 9-dimension model from 'Governance & Regulatory Interdependency'
-- materialized as 6 DIMENSION tables + 6 MATRIX tables.
-- ============================================================
-- DIMENSIONS (Layer A — drivers):
--   dim_sectors          25 KSA sectors with primary_regulator + ISIC
--   dim_org_types        17 (gov ministry/authority, JSC listed/closed, LLC, sole prop, foreign branch, RHQ, JV, NGO, CNI…)
--   dim_org_sizes         5 Monsha'at (Micro/Small/Medium/Large/Enterprise)
--   dim_business_models  12 (B2B, B2C, B2G, B2B2C, C2C, SaaS, FinTech, Manufacturing, Franchise…)
--   dim_ownership         9 (100_SAUDI, MAJ_SAUDI, FAMILY, PIF_OWNED, GOVT_OWNED, LISTED_TADAWUL, FOREIGN_SUB, JV, MISA)
--   dim_frameworks       42 KSA + international with regulator+version+scope
--
-- MATRICES (Layer B — engine rules):
--   matrix1_sector_framework        294  sector → mandatory/conditional/voluntary frameworks
--   matrix2_size_framework           18  size threshold rules (e.g. ZATCA-VAT > SAR 375K)
--   matrix3_bizmodel_framework       22  business model → additional frameworks
--   matrix4_ownership_obligations    10  ownership → scrutiny + audit frequency
--   matrix5_composite_personas       41  pre-computed (sector,size,type,model,ownership) → frameworks
--   matrix6_evidence_per_persona  1,835  evidence required per persona × framework
-- ============================================================

